{
  "_comment": "Canonical registry of every CLI subcommand verb exposed by `brainstorm` / `storm`. The contract-check gate at scripts/contract-checks/cli-subcommand-registry.mjs walks packages/cli/src/bin/brainstorm.ts, extracts every .command() call, and fails the build if (a) a new verb shows up in source but isn't registered here, or (b) a registered verb has no source declaration. Add new verbs to this list in the same PR that introduces them.",
  "_categories": {
    "tool-driven": "Backed by a defineTool() entry — the verb is the CLI alias for a tool.",
    "contract-driven": "Backed by a platform contract endpoint — the verb is a CLI dispatcher for the HTTP surface.",
    "infrastructure": "Session/config/vault/projects/etc. — operator-level commands with no tool/contract counterpart.",
    "agent-loop": "The chat REPL, agent dispatch, plan mode, orchestration — the core interactive surface.",
    "ecosystem": "Manage the brainstorm ecosystem itself — onboarding, peers, sync, setup."
  },
